  "slug": "giving-is-happiness",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2789_giving-is-happiness.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Once upon a time, there was a king who dearly loved his son. The young prince could have anything he wanted, yet he often wore a frown and was very unhappy.",
    "One day, a man came to the palace and told the king that he knew how to make the prince happy. The king replied with delight, “If you can really do that, I’ll grant you anything you ask for.”",
    "The man gave the prince a letter and told him to follow its instructions. The prince did as it said, and before long, he became the happiest young person in the kingdom. As it turned out, the letter contained just a few words: “Do one good deed for someone else every day!”"
  ],
  "english_full": "Once upon a time, there was a king who dearly loved his son. The young prince could have anything he wanted, yet he often wore a frown and was very unhappy.\n\nOne day, a man came to the palace and told the king that he knew how to make the prince happy. The king replied with delight, “If you can really do that, I’ll grant you anything you ask for.”\n\nThe man gave the prince a letter and told him to follow its instructions. The prince did as it said, and before long, he became the happiest young person in the kingdom. As it turned out, the letter contained just a few words: “Do one good deed for someone else every day!”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Одна́жды, давным-давно, был король, который лю́бил своего́ сы́на. Молодо́й принц мог име́ть всё, что он жела́л, но он ча́сто насу́пливал брови́ и был очень несча́стным.",
    "Одна́жды к дворе́цу пришёл муж и ска́зал коро́лю, что он зна́ет, как сделать принца сча́стливым. Король с радостью ответи́л: «Если вы деи́стви́тельно можете это сделать, я дам вам всё, что вы попроси́те.»",
    "Муж дал принцу письмο и ска́зал ему следовать инстрýкциям. Принц сде́лал, как было сказа́но, и вскоре стал сча́стливейшим молоды́м челове́ком в короле́встве. Как вскоре вы́яснилось, письмо соде́ржало всего́ не́сколько слов: «Сде́лай одно́ до́брое де́ло для кого́-то друго́го ка́ждый день!»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Odnázhdy, davnym-davno, byl korol', kotoryi lýbil svoegó sýna. Molodýi prints mog imét' vsyo, chto on zhelál, no on chaísto nasúplival bróvi i byl ochen' neschástnym.",
    "Odnázhdy k dvorétsu prishël muzh i skázal korol'u, chto on znáet, kak sdelát' printśa schastlivym. Korol' s radúshchyu otvetíl: «Esli vy deýstvitel'no mozhete eto sdelát', ya dam vam vsyo, chto vy poprosíte.»",
    "Muzh dal printśu pismó i skázal emu sledovat' instruktsiím. Prints sdélal, kak bylo skazáno, i vskore stal schastlivéishym molodým chelovékom v korolévstve. Kak vskore výyasniĺos', pismó sodérzhalo vsegó néskol'ko slov: «Sdélai odnó dóbroe délo dlya kogó-to drugógo kázhdyi den'!»"
  ],
